# {{ project_name }} Operations

## Instructions

### Step 1: Local Development
{% if local_mode %}
Start the Docker Compose stack:
```bash
cd {{ work_dir_name }}
docker compose up -d
```
Expected: All containers healthy within 60 seconds.
{% else %}
Deploy to Azure using Bicep:
```bash
cd {{ work_dir_name }}
az deployment sub create \
  --location {{ region }} \
  --template-file infra/main.bicep \
  --parameters projectName={{ project_name }}
```
For local development instead:
```bash
cd {{ work_dir_name }}
docker compose up -d  # if docker-compose.yml was generated with --local
```
{% endif %}

### Step 2: Run the Ralph Loop
The Ralph loop iterates {{ iterations }} times, implementing PRD tasks:
```bash
cd {{ work_dir_name }}
bash ralph.sh        # Linux/macOS
# or
.\ralph.ps1          # Windows
```
Each iteration: reads progress.txt → picks next task → implements → commits.

### Step 3: Health Checks
```bash
